  "header_text": "Quick Links: Contact UsFacebookXLinkedInInstagram English is your current preferred language. Search My Property Services Doing Business Community Government Join our Team Select the Escape key to close the menu. Focus will then be set to the first menu item.",
  "footer_text": "Under Florida law, e-mail addresses are public records. If you do not want your e-mail address released in response to a public records request, do not send electronic mail to this entity. Instead contact this office by phone or in writing. Site Footer Contact Us Osceola County 1 Courthouse Square, Suite 4700 Kissimmee, FL 34741 Get Directions T 407-742-2ASK(2275) Site Footer Share & Connect Facebook Twitter LinkedIn Instagram Vimeo Nextdoor About our Photos Directory Site Footer Get Involved Join our Team Have Your Say Volunteering Subscribe Sitemap | Privacy Policy & Terms of Use | ADA Notice of Compliance © 2026 Osceola County | Powered by Granicus",
  "above_fold_text": "Contact Us Facebook X LinkedIn Instagram English is your current preferred language. Search My Property Services Doing Business Community Government Join our Team Select the Escape key to close the menu. Focus will then be set to the first menu item. Home / Government / Agencies and Departments Directory / Office of Management and Budget Office of Management and Budget The Office of Management and Budget (OMB) is a key department in Osceola County that helps with planning, implementing, and monitoring the County's annual budget. The budget includes how the County spends money on various programs and services, as well as how it raises money from taxes and fees. Contact Us Phone 407-742-1800 Email Budget@osceola.org Website County Budget and Financial Statements Location 1 Courthouse Square, Suite 4400 Kissimmee, FL Back to top ✖ Need help? Chat with our AI Assistant. Osceola AI Assistant",
  "visible_text": "Skip to main content\nQuick Links:\nContact UsFacebookXLinkedInInstagram\nEnglish\nis your current preferred language.\nSearch\nMy Property\nServices\nDoing Business\nCommunity\nGovernment\nJoin our Team\n\nSelect the Escape key to close the menu. Focus will then be set to the first menu item.\n\nHome / Government/ Agencies and Departments Directory / Office of Management and Budget\nOffice of Management and Budget\n\nThe Office of Management and Budget (OMB) is a key department in Osceola County that helps with planning, implementing, and monitoring the County's annual budget. The budget includes how the County spends money on various programs and services, as well as how it raises money from taxes and fees.\n\nOMB also oversees the Special Assessments, which are charges for specific services or benefits that some residents or property owners receive.\n\nOMB presents the budget and Five-Year Capital Improvement Plan each year.\n\nFunctions of OMB\nAgenda Items\nAnnual Budget\nBudget Monitoring\nBudget Adjustments\nCapital Improvement Plan\nNon Ad Valorem Assessment Roll\nStudies and Analysis\n\nView OMB Budget Documents & Reports\n\nView Special Assessments\n\nView OMB Frequent Questions\n\nView OMB Glossary\n\nDepartment Head\nMatthew Fuhrer, Director of Management & Budget\nContact Us\nPhone\n407-742-1800\nEmail\nBudget@osceola.org\nWebsite\nCounty Budget and Financial Statements\nLocation\n1 Courthouse Square, Suite 4400\nKissimmee, FL\n34741\nView Map\nHours\nSunday Closed\nMonday \n08:00 AM–05:00 PM\nTuesday \n08:00 AM–05:00 PM\nWednesday \n08:00 AM–05:00 PM\nThursday \n08:00 AM–05:00 PM\nFriday \n08:00 AM–05:00 PM\nSaturday Closed\nWas this page helpful?\nHelp us improve this site\nBack to top\n\nUnder Florida law, e-mail addresses are public records. If you do not want your e-mail address released in response to a public records request, do not send electronic mail to this entity. Instead contact this office by phone or in writing.\n\nSite Footer\nContact Us\n\nOsceola County\n1 Courthouse Square, Suite 4700\nKissimmee, FL 34741\n\nGet Directions\n\nT 407-742-2ASK(2275)\n\nSite Footer\nShare & Connect\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nVimeo\nNextdoor\n\nAbout our Photos\n\nDirectory\n\nSite Footer\nGet Involved\nJoin our Team\nHave Your Say\nVolunteering\nSubscribe\nSitemap | Privacy Policy & Terms of Use | ADA Notice of Compliance\n© 2026 Osceola County | Powered by Granicus\n✖\n\nNeed help?\nChat with our AI Assistant.\n\nOsceola AI Assistant",
  "forms_present": 1
